"Show the combo in the editor. The true 'Power Mode' experience","Use the status bar. A more subdued experience.","Use the default value. May be override by other settings.","Turn off the combo entirely."],"description":"Control where all the combo information is visible."},"powermode.combo.threshold":{"default":0,"type":"number","description":"The combo number needed to activate POWER MODE!!! and start shaking and exploding the screen! If the value is 0, POWER MODE will always be active."},"powermode.combo.timeout":{"default":10,"type":"number","description":"The number of seconds before the combo resets. If the value is 0, the timer will never reset."},"powermode.combo.counterEnabled":{"type":"string","default":"default","enum":["show","hide","default"],"enumDescriptions":["Show the combo counter","Hide the combo counter","Use the default value. May be overridden by other settings."],"description":"Control whether the combo counter is visible."},"powermode.combo.counterSize":{"type":"number","default":3,"minimum":0,"description":"Control the size of the Combo Meter text"},"powermode.combo.timerEnabled":{"type":"string","default":"default","enum":["show","hide","default"],"enumDescriptions":["Show the combo timer","Hide the combo timer","Use the default value. May be overridden by other settings."],"description":"Control whether the combo timer is visible."},"powermode.combo.customCss":{"description":"Set custom CSS that will apply to the combo element.","type":"object","default":{}}}},{"title":"Shake","order":2,"properties":{"powermode.shake.enabled":{"order":0,"type":"boolean","default":true,"description":"Set to false to disable shaking while typing"},"powermode.shake.intensity":{"type":"number","default":3,"description":"The intensity with which the screen shakes"}}},{"title":"Explosions","order":3,"properties":{"powermode.explosions.enabled":{"order":0,"type":"boolean","default":true,"description":"Set to false to disable explosions while typing"},"powermode.explosions.maxExplosions":{"type":"number","default":1,"description":"The maximum number of simultaneous explosions"},"powermode.explosions.size":{"type":"number","default":6,"description":"The size of the explosions. For value X, the height is set to X rem and the width to X ch"},"powermode.explosions.frequency":{"type":"number","default":2,"description":"The number of key strokes needed to trigger an explosion. 2 means every second keystroke will explode, 1 means every key stroke."},"powermode.explosions.offset":{"type":"number","default":0.35,"description":"The vertical offset of the explosions. Increasing it will move the explosions up, decreasing it will move them down."},"powermode.explosions.customExplosions":{"order":16,"type":"array","items":"string","default":[],"markdownDescription":"This value will go into the 'url()' part of a background image. It should be a base64 encoded gif or **https** URL _without_ quotes."},"powermode.explosions.backgroundMode":{"type":"string","default":"mask","enum":["mask","image"],"enumDescriptions":["Uses the gifs as a mask to let the background color come through (similar to atom power mode)","Display the actual gif."],"description":"Affects the css properties used to display the gif."},"powermode.explosions.gifMode":{"type":"string","default":"continue","enum":["continue","restart"],"enumDescriptions":["Resume playing it from its previous point","Restart the gif each time it is shown. This is useful when you have multiple visible gifs, but may reduce performance"],"description":"Control the 'playback' mode of the gifs."},"powermode.explosions.explosionOrder":{"description":"Determines how the explosions are cycled. 'random' (default) picks from the list randomly. 'sequential' goes through the list in order, and a number will select the explosion at that (zero based)index in the list","oneOf":[{"type":"string","enum":["random","sequential"]},{"type":"number"}],"default":"random"},"powermode.explosions.duration":{"description